
@startuml
title Завдання 3 — Prototype: пакети проживання готелю

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

class Task3 <<Client>> {
  {static} +log(source: String, message: String): void
  {static} +main(args: String[]): void
}

class AccommodationPackage <<ConcretePrototype>> {
  -nameOfPackage: String
  -meals: String
  -transfer: String
  -spaProcedures: List<String>
  -skiPass: SkiPass
  -discount: Discount
  +AccommodationPackage(nameOfPackage: String, meals: String, transfer: String, spaProcedures: List<String>, skiPass: SkiPass, discount: Discount)
  -AccommodationPackage(other: AccommodationPackage)
  +copy(): AccommodationPackage
  +addSpaProcedure(procedure: String): void
  +setSkiPassDays(days: int): void
  +setDiscountPercent(percent: int): void
  +toString(): String
}

class SkiPass <<Deep-copyable part>> {
  -days: int
  -zone: String
  +SkiPass(days: int, zone: String)
  +setDays(days: int): void
  +copy(): SkiPass
  +toString(): String
}

class Discount <<Deep-copyable part>> {
  -name: String
  -percent: int
  +Discount(name: String, percent: int)
  +setPercent(percent: int): void
  +copy(): Discount
  +toString(): String
}

Task3 ..> AccommodationPackage : creates / calls copy()
Task3 ..> SkiPass : creates
Task3 ..> Discount : creates

AccommodationPackage "1" *-- "1" SkiPass : contains
AccommodationPackage "1" *-- "1" Discount : contains

AccommodationPackage ..> Task3 : calls log()

note right of AccommodationPackage
  Prototype role:
  copy() creates a deep copy
  using a private copy constructor.

  The copy includes:
  - SPA list
  - SkiPass
  - Discount

  Copying does not repeat
  the expensive initialization.
end note

note right of Task3
  Client role:
  - Starts program execution
  - Creates the standard package
  - Creates guest packages
  - Logs the main execution stages
end note

@enduml
